#: data/id.blankonlinux.warsi.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"Warsi is based on Bazaar and heavily patched by BlankOn Linux. Besides "
"Flatpak apps, it also keeps the system's Debian APT packages up to date."
msgstr ""
"Warsi berbasis Bazaar dan dimodifikasi besar-besaran oleh BlankOn Linux. "
"Selain aplikasi Flatpak, Warsi juga menjaga paket APT Debian di sistem tetap "
"mutakhir."
